            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>In the present invention, a terminal can appropriately perform a random-access process. In a terminal (100), a wireless transmission unit (111) transmits a random-access signal including at least a data part. A rank determination unit (107) controls the configuration of the data part on the basis of a parameter regarding the transmission of the random-access signal.</p>
